<section class="reviews-section section" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="reviews-header-row">
      <div>
        <span class="section__eyebrow">Social Proof</span>
        <h2 class="section__title" style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:0">
          Loved by Thousands of<br>Homeowners ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-aggregate">
        <div class="reviews-aggregate__score">4.8</div>
        <div class="reviews-aggregate__detail">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--gray-600);font-weight:500">2,347 verified reviews</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reviews-grid">

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#1d4ed8)">S</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Sarah M.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · Chicago, IL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"My room was freezing before this — now it's actually warm!"</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          Crazy difference honestly. I used to have to sleep with 3 blankets because my bedroom window was so drafty. Applied AirGuard in about 5 minutes and the next morning I woke up warm for the first time all winter. Also my heating bill dropped $47 this month!
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a34a,#166534)">J</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Jason R.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · Denver, CO</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"Super easy to install and actually works."</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          I was skeptical at first — I've tried other products that claimed to stop drafts and they were all garbage. This one actually delivers. Did all 6 windows in my house in under 20 minutes. Can't even see it on the windows. Highly recommend.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dc2626,#991b1b)">E</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Emily K.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · Boston, MA</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"Did my whole apartment in 10 minutes. No more drafts!"</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          I live in an older apartment building with terrible window seals. This stuff is incredible. Ordered 2 rolls and had every window and the gap under my front door sealed in one afternoon. The difference was immediate — zero cold air coming in. Saving so much on heat.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#b45309)">M</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Mike T.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · Minneapolis, MN</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"This tape paid for itself in 3 days."</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          Minnesota winters are brutal and my heating bill was insane. Applied AirGuard to every window and the gap around my sliding door. My heating costs dropped noticeably the very first week. 100% worth it — just bought 3 more rolls for my parents' house.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#6d28d9)">L</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">Linda P.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · Seattle, WA</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"Finally a product that actually does what it says."</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          Clear, strong, holds perfectly. I was worried it would look bad on my windows but it's basically invisible. Been on for 3 months now through rain, cold, and wind and it hasn't budged at all. Exactly what I needed.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" data-animate>
        <div class="review-card__stars"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span></div>
        <div class="review-card__header">
          <div class="reviewer-avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0891b2,#0e7490)">D</div>
          <div>
            <div class="reviewer-name">David H.</div>
            <div class="review-verified">✅ Verified Buyer · New York, NY</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="review-card__title">"Bought 3 packs. My whole building could use this."</div>
        <div class="review-card__body">
          NYC apartment with old windows — absolute game changer. I used to feel a constant cold breeze even with the windows closed. Now nothing. The tape is clear, sticks perfectly to the frame, and peeled off cleanly when I tested it. Ordering more.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

